      "message": "No, we don\u0027t. This information is in the manifest (like \u003cuses-library\u003e tags). We cannot parse manifests at the time when Soong generates build rules. I have a bug fir this: https://b.corp.google.com/issues/174355777 (but not much hope fixing it in the near future).",
